# Sacramento Dental Medicine content

- Edit practice facts, hours, services, doctors, reviews, and schema in `src/data/site.ts`.
- Keep design tokens in `src/app/globals.css`. Do not invent a second palette.
- Verified phone is (916) 727-6453. Address is 4320 Elverta Rd #3, Antelope, CA 95843. Doctors on the public site: Michael Narodovich, DMD and Lucas L. Sheppard, DMD.
- Do not invent insurance lists, CareCredit, a front-desk email, or a Google star rating.
- Same-day emergency visits are offered when possible, not guaranteed.
- Scheduler requires name plus a phone number or an email (at least one, not both).
- Scheduler delivery uses Formspree (`https://formspree.io/f/xvkpdvyz`). Keep email optional in the Formspree dashboard so phone-only requests succeed. Optional `LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL` is a second hop. Without a successful Formspree response, do not claim the front desk received a lead.
- Do not connect or cut over `sacramentodentalmedicine.com`. Canonical URLs follow `src/lib/site-url.ts` (the Vercel production host until cutover).
- Hero / waiting / still-life images are atmospheric stand-ins, not photographs of the Elverta Road office.
- This repo is Sacramento Dental Medicine only. Waikiki Dental lives in `enzo-prism/waikiki-dental`.
